    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      226.97,
      401.9,
      250.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      262.97,
      401.86,
      286.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Local AuthoritiesElections (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      401.89,
      334.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 22 (4) (2B) of Act, No. 22 of 2012 be amendedby deleting the entirety of the sub-section and substitutingtherefor the following :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      346.97,
      401.9,
      430.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cNotwithstanding any provisions to the contraryin this Ordinance, not less than thirty per centum ofthe total number of candidates and additional personswhose names appear in each nomination papersubmitted under sub-section (2) of this section, shallconsist of females, and not less than twenty per centumof the said number shall consist of youth\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      442.97,
      401.9,
      466.31
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      300.79,
      451.29,
      329.06
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof Section22(4) (2B).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
